<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ-E AUG NET SWINGS TO PLN 53.000.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ-E AUG NET SWINGS TO PLN 53.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.05 vs   0.30 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.03 vs   0.41 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.11 vs   0.43 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    1.78 vs   1.70</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.67 vs   0.20 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.92 vs   0.10 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.65 vs   0.37 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   30.60 vs  15.44</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektromonta Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
